Showcasing an instance, we see something similar to the snippet below _(the one attached below is from [`GammaTradeMarket#autoHedge()`](https://github.com/code-423n4/2024-05-predy/blob/a9246db5f874a91fb71c296aac6a66902289306a/src/markets/gamma/GammaTradeMarket.sol#L268-L271))_.

